bug_report:
bogus -Wvexing-parse with trailing-return-type
```
void
fn ()
{
  auto f () -> auto;
}
```

emits

q.C: In function ‘void fn()’:
q.C:4:10: warning: empty parentheses were disambiguated as a function declaration [-Wvexing-parse]
    4 |   auto f () -> auto;
      |          ^~

but it can't be a variable due to the trailing-return-type.
